{"seq":2,"slug":"supplier-scope3-data-collect","title":"供应链上游 Scope3 数据采集（PCF/物流碳聚合）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/esg-scope3-sustainability-reporting/scope3-data-aggregation/supplier-scope3-data-collect","wordCount":2629,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"供应链上游-scope3-数据采集-pcf-物流碳聚合\">供应链上游 Scope3 数据采集（PCF/物流碳聚合）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>范围 3 的类别 1（采购的商品与服务）和类别 4（上游运输与配送）在多数跨境企业里合计占碳足迹的一半以上，而这两个类别的活动数据<strong>全都不在自己手里</strong>：商品制造的能耗在代工厂，原料的碳强度在更上游的供应商，运输的油耗在承运商。企业面对的是一道分布式数据收集题，而不是一道核算题。</p>\n<p>这道题的难点有三个层次。<strong>数据可得性</strong>：供应商有没有做过产品碳足迹（PCF）核算？绝大多数中小供应商没有。<strong>数据可比性</strong>：如果供应商各自用不同方法算，得到的数字能否相加？<strong>数据质量</strong>：拿到的数字是实测还是行业均值估算，能不能满足鉴证要求？这三个层次决定了采集系统必须同时具备「索取、规范、分级」三种能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[采购清单&lt;br/&gt;按支出与碳强度分级] --&gt; B{供应商能力判断}&#10;  B --&gt;|有 PCF 能力| C[索取一手 PCF 报告&lt;br/&gt;含方法学与边界]&#10;  B --&gt;|无能力| D[提供工具/模板&lt;br/&gt;或按行业均值估算]&#10;  B --&gt;|有产品但无数据| E[按品类/材质/&lt;br/&gt;重量做代理估算]&#10;  C --&gt; F[数据质量分级与校验]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[按采购量加权聚合]&#10;  G --&gt; H[类别1 企业级排放]&#10;  A --&gt; I[承运商与物流账单]&#10;  I --&gt; J[按运输活动计算]&#10;  J --&gt; K[类别4 企业级排放]&#10;  H --&gt; L[范围3 报告值&lt;br/&gt;+ 一手数据占比]&#10;  K --&gt; L\">graph TD\n  A[采购清单&lt;br/&gt;按支出与碳强度分级] --&gt; B{供应商能力判断}\n  B --&gt;|有 PCF 能力| C[索取一手 PCF 报告&lt;br/&gt;含方法学与边界]\n  B --&gt;|无能力| D[提供工具/模板&lt;br/&gt;或按行业均值估算]\n  B --&gt;|有产品但无数据| E[按品类/材质/&lt;br/&gt;重量做代理估算]\n  C --&gt; F[数据质量分级与校验]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[按采购量加权聚合]\n  G --&gt; H[类别1 企业级排放]\n  A --&gt; I[承运商与物流账单]\n  I --&gt; J[按运输活动计算]\n  J --&gt; K[类别4 企业级排放]\n  H --&gt; L[范围3 报告值&lt;br/&gt;+ 一手数据占比]\n  K --&gt; L</pre><p>一个关键的工程前提是：<strong>单笔/单品核算能力必须先存在</strong>。类别 1 的聚合本质上是对单品 PCF 的加权求和，如果每个供应商报来的是「工厂总排放 ÷ 总产量」这种粗糙分摊，聚合结果就只能按估算处理。单品核算的方法、边界与因子来自另一条独立链路（跨境商品与物流碳足迹核算）——本 hub 消费它的输出，不重复定义单品边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一手数据与二手数据的区分\">一手数据与二手数据的区分</h2><h3 id=\"ghg-protocol-的数据分级\">GHG Protocol 的数据分级</h3><p>范围 3 标准把数据分为<strong>一手数据</strong>（primary data，来自价值链中特定活动或供应商的实测）与<strong>二手数据</strong>（secondary data，来自行业均值、数据库、文献、或估算）。标准并不要求全部使用一手数据，但要求<strong>优先获取一手数据、并披露二手数据的使用情况与理由</strong>。其计算指引同时提供了 15 个类别的逐类计算方法（<a href=\"https://ghgprotocol.org/scope-3-calculation-guidance-2\">GHG Protocol，Scope 3 Calculation Guidance</a>）。这是采集系统的设计基线：不是追求 100% 一手，而是让「哪些是一手、哪些是二手、为什么」可被查询。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据质量等级的可操作定义\">数据质量等级的可操作定义</h3><p>把标准的要求落成可判定的级别，需要一组可校验的判据，而不只是标签。一个可用的分级表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等级</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>典型来源</th>\n<th>可否用于鉴证</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 实测</td>\n<td>供应商提供特定产品或工艺的实测排放，含方法学与边界</td>\n<td>供应商 PCF 报告</td>\n<td>是，需核验方法学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 计算</td>\n<td>用供应商实测活动数据（能耗/产量）× 权威因子</td>\n<td>供应商能耗单 + 因子库</td>\n<td>是，需核验活动数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 代理</td>\n<td>用同类产品/工艺的行业均值，按产品属性裁剪</td>\n<td>行业 LCA 数据库</td>\n<td>有限，需披露局限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 支出</td>\n<td>用采购金额 × 行业支出排放因子</td>\n<td>财务系统</td>\n<td>仅作筛查与兜底</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>采集系统的价值在于<strong>把每个供应商的数据提升一个等级</strong>：从 L4 支出法起步识别热点，对高支出高强度的品类推动供应商做到 L2 或 L1。分的等级与占比会成为下一章改进度量的核心指标，见 <a href=\"../esg-report-ops/esg-data-quality-gap-metric\">ESG 数据完整率/缺口与改进度量</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据校验的硬规则\">数据校验的硬规则</h3><p>供应商报上来的数字必须过校验才能入库，否则会污染聚合值。几条必备的校验：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>边界完整性</strong>：PCF 报告是否声明了系统边界（摇篮到大门、摇篮到坟墓）、是否包含上游运输、是否按 ISO 14067 或 GHG Protocol 产品标准执行。</li>\n<li><strong>量纲与单位</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>kgCO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{kgCO}_2\\text{e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kgCO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">e</span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>tCO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{tCO}_2\\text{e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tCO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">e</span></span></span></span></span></span>、每件与每公斤的混淆是最高频错误。</li>\n<li><strong>异常值</strong>：与同品类同工艺的中位数量级偏差超过阈值时标红，要求供应商说明。</li>\n<li><strong>版本与时点</strong>：PCF 报告有核算年份，跨年复用必须标注。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"采集通道的设计\">采集通道的设计</h2><h3 id=\"供应商分级与请求策略\">供应商分级与请求策略</h3><p>对所有供应商发出同样深度的数据请求是低效且会引发抵触的。正确做法是按<strong>支出 × 碳强度</strong>二维分级：高支出高强度的供应商优先索取一手数据并提供技术支持，低支出的长尾用支出法或行业均值兜底。这个分级逻辑与采购端的供应商风险管理分级可以共用一张表。</p>\n<h3 id=\"请求到回收的状态机\">请求到回收的状态机</h3><p>数据请求是一个有生命周期的对象，需要状态跟踪，否则「去年发了三百份问卷、回收了四十份」这种情况会重复发生。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;request_id&quot;: &quot;supplier-data-2026-Q2-00417&quot;,&#10;  &quot;supplier_id&quot;: 80213,&#10;  &quot;category&quot;: &quot;C1&quot;,&#10;  &quot;requested_level&quot;: &quot;L2&quot;,&#10;  &quot;status&quot;: &quot;in_progress&quot;,&#10;  &quot;states&quot;: [&quot;issued&quot;, &quot;acknowledged&quot;, &quot;submitted&quot;, &quot;validated&quot;, &quot;accepted&quot;, &quot;rejected&quot;, &quot;escalated&quot;],&#10;  &quot;due_date&quot;: &quot;2026-06-30&quot;,&#10;  &quot;escalation_path&quot;: [&quot;procurement_owner&quot;, &quot;category_manager&quot;, &quot;supplier_director&quot;],&#10;  &quot;received_artifact&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;pcf_report&quot;,&#10;    &quot;system_boundary&quot;: &quot;cradle_to_gate&quot;,&#10;    &quot;includes_upstream_transport&quot;: false,&#10;    &quot;method&quot;: &quot;ISO 14067&quot;,&#10;    &quot;reporting_year&quot;: 2025&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"request_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"supplier-data-2026-Q2-00417\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"supplier_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80213</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"category\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"C1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"requested_level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"L2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"in_progress\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"states\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"issued\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"acknowledged\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"submitted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"validated\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"accepted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rejected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"escalated\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"due_date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-06-30\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"escalation_path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"procurement_owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"category_manager\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"supplier_director\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"received_artifact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pcf_report\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"system_boundary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cradle_to_gate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"includes_upstream_transport\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"method\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ISO 14067\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reporting_year\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2025</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>includes_upstream_transport</code> 这个字段直接对接上一篇讲的防重复机制——它在请求阶段就明确了边界归属，而不是等到聚合时才发现重复，见 <a href=\"ghg-scope1-2-3-boundary\">范围 1/2/3 边界与核算口径</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"把数据请求写进采购条件\">把数据请求写进采购条件</h3><p>自愿请求的回收率长期偏低。有效的杠杆是把数据交付写进商业关系：<strong>在供应商准入与续约条件里加入 ESG 数据条款</strong>，把数据交付与供应商评分、订单分配或付款条件关联。这不是要挟，而是让合规成本在商业关系中显性化。合同条款的法律设计属于另一条独立链路（供应链社会责任尽调的执法应对）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用共同框架降低摩擦\">用共同框架降低摩擦</h3><p>供应商可能同时被几十个客户索要碳数据，各自格式不同。缓解摩擦的方式是采用行业共同的数据交换框架，例如 WBCSD 的 PACT（Partnership for Carbon Transparency）旨在让产品级碳数据可比较、可验证地计算与交换。遵循共同框架的收益是双向的：供应商填一次，多个客户复用；买方拿到的数据有统一的字段与质量标识，可以自动入库。系统设计上应把「收到的数据符合哪个交换规范」作为一等字段，而不是把不同来源硬塞进一个自由文本字段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"物流碳聚合-类别-4-与类别-9\">物流碳聚合：类别 4 与类别 9</h2><h3 id=\"运输活动的计算形式\">运输活动的计算形式</h3><p>运输排放的基本计算形式是活动数据乘以排放因子：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mtext>质量</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mtext>距离</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mtext>因子</mtext><mrow><mtext>方式</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = \\sum_{i} \\left( \\text{质量}_i \\times \\text{距离}_i \\times \\text{因子}_{\\text{方式},i} \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">质量</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">距离</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">因子</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">方式</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对跨境物流而言，<code>质量</code> 是货物毛重（含包装），<code>距离</code> 是实际运输路径距离，<code>因子</code> 应按运输方式（海运、空运、铁路、公路）与载运率区分，单位通常是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>gCO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>e</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>t</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>km</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{gCO}_2\\text{e}/\\text{t}\\cdot\\text{km}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gCO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">e</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">t</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span></span></span></span></span>。承运商若能提供实际油耗，则优先用油耗乘以燃料因子，等级从 L3 提升到 L1。</p>\n<h3 id=\"计费重与实重的陷阱\">计费重与实重的陷阱</h3><p>跨境物流的计费常用体积重或计费重，而排放计算必须用<strong>实际质量</strong>。用计费重会导致轻泡货的排放被系统性高估。同样，多式联运的分段距离与转运节点必须分解，不能按起终点直线距离计算。这一口径与 144 hub 中运输排放建模的处理一致——本 hub 的企业级聚合直接复用那套单笔结果，只做加权求和与去重。</p>\n<h3 id=\"承运商数据的获取方式\">承运商数据的获取方式</h3><p>承运商通常按季度或年度提供排放报告，格式与粒度各异。可行的做法是<strong>先按行业默认因子计算内部基线，再用承运商实际数据替换</strong>，并记录替换比例。这个「先算后换」的策略让报告在数据不到位时也能出具，同时保留改进空间。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE logistics_emission_fact (&#10;  fiscal_year      SMALLINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  shipment_group   VARCHAR(64)   NOT NULL,     -- 按线路/方式聚合的批次&#10;  mode             VARCHAR(16)   NOT NULL,     -- &#39;sea&#39;,&#39;air&#39;,&#39;rail&#39;,&#39;road&#39;&#10;  gross_weight_kg  NUMERIC(18,3) NOT NULL,     -- 实重，不是计费重&#10;  distance_km      NUMERIC(18,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  emission_tco2e   NUMERIC(18,6) NOT NULL,&#10;  factor_source    VARCHAR(64)   NOT NULL,     -- 因子库版本或承运商实测&#10;  data_quality     VARCHAR(8)    NOT NULL,     -- &#39;L1&#39;..&#39;L4&#39;&#10;  category_code    VARCHAR(8)    NOT NULL,     -- &#39;C4&#39; 上游 / &#39;C9&#39; 下游&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (fiscal_year, shipment_group, mode)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> logistics_emission_fact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fiscal_year      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shipment_group   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按线路/方式聚合的批次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mode             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'sea','air','rail','road'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gross_weight_kg  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 实重，不是计费重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  distance_km      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  emission_tco2e   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  factor_source    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 因子库版本或承运商实测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  data_quality     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'L1'..'L4'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category_code    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'C4' 上游 / 'C9' 下游</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (fiscal_year, shipment_group, mode)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"聚合-去重与不确定性\">聚合、去重与不确定性</h2><h3 id=\"从单品到企业级\">从单品到企业级</h3><p>聚合是加权求和，但加权口径要与财务口径对齐：类别 1 应覆盖当期的采购量，而不是付款量；退货与换货要按实际归属期间调整。聚合结果必须能分解回明细，因为鉴证会抽样核查。若聚合值无法反向定位到凭证，等于没有证据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用蒙特卡洛表达不确定性\">用蒙特卡洛表达不确定性</h3><p>二手数据与估算带来的不确定性不应被掩盖成一个精确数字。实务上常用<strong>蒙特卡洛模拟</strong>给出区间：为每个数据点按其质量等级设定分布（实测数据用窄分布、支出法用宽分布），多次抽样得到总量分布，报告均值与分位数。这既是披露的最佳实践，也让「哪一类数据质量的改善最能缩小总不确定性」变得可计算——通常答案是优先改善占比大且分布宽的那几类。</p>\n<h3 id=\"改善路径的优先级排序\">改善路径的优先级排序</h3><p>改善资源应投在「贡献大 × 质量差」的象限。给出一个可操作的排序分数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{i} = \\frac{E_i}{\\sum E} \\times (1 - q_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 类的排放量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是其数据质量分（L1 到 L4 映射到 1.0 到 0.25）。这个分数同时被排放占比与数据缺口放大，直接指出下一年的采集重点。它的输出会进入第四章的缺口度量体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>类别 1 与类别 4 通常占跨境企业碳足迹一半以上，其数据全在供应商与承运商手里，本质是分布式数据收集问题。</li>\n<li>采集系统要同时具备索取、规范、分级三种能力；单品核算能力（见 144 hub）是聚合的前提。</li>\n<li>数据分一手与二手，须落成可校验的质量等级（L1 实测到 L4 支出），并把每个供应商的数据逐级提级。</li>\n<li>用状态机跟踪数据请求的生命周期，把数据交付写进采购准入条件，并采用 PACT 这类共同交换框架降低供应商摩擦。</li>\n<li>物流碳用「质量 × 距离 × 方式因子」计算，必须用实重而非计费重，多式联运要分段；承运商数据到位后用实测替换默认因子。</li>\n<li>聚合必须可反向分解到凭证；用蒙特卡洛表达不确定性，按「贡献大 × 质量差」排序改善优先级。</li>\n<li>下一步：社会维度的数据聚合见 <a href=\"social-data-supplier-aggregate\">社会尽调/劳工数据聚合</a>；聚合结果的留痕与鉴证见 <a href=\"../assurance-governance/data-lineage-evidence-trace\">ESG 数据血缘、留痕与可追溯</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"供应链上游 Scope3 数据采集（PCF/物流碳聚合）","id":"供应链上游-scope3-数据采集-pcf-物流碳聚合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"一手数据与二手数据的区分","id":"一手数据与二手数据的区分"},{"level":3,"text":"GHG Protocol 的数据分级","id":"ghg-protocol-的数据分级"},{"level":3,"text":"数据质量等级的可操作定义","id":"数据质量等级的可操作定义"},{"level":3,"text":"数据校验的硬规则","id":"数据校验的硬规则"},{"level":2,"text":"采集通道的设计","id":"采集通道的设计"},{"level":3,"text":"供应商分级与请求策略","id":"供应商分级与请求策略"},{"level":3,"text":"请求到回收的状态机","id":"请求到回收的状态机"},{"level":3,"text":"把数据请求写进采购条件","id":"把数据请求写进采购条件"},{"level":3,"text":"用共同框架降低摩擦","id":"用共同框架降低摩擦"},{"level":2,"text":"物流碳聚合：类别 4 与类别 9","id":"物流碳聚合-类别-4-与类别-9"},{"level":3,"text":"运输活动的计算形式","id":"运输活动的计算形式"},{"level":3,"text":"计费重与实重的陷阱","id":"计费重与实重的陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"承运商数据的获取方式","id":"承运商数据的获取方式"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合、去重与不确定性","id":"聚合-去重与不确定性"},{"level":3,"text":"从单品到企业级","id":"从单品到企业级"},{"level":3,"text":"用蒙特卡洛表达不确定性","id":"用蒙特卡洛表达不确定性"},{"level":3,"text":"改善路径的优先级排序","id":"改善路径的优先级排序"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"范围 1/2/3 边界与核算口径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/esg-scope3-sustainability-reporting/scope3-data-aggregation/ghg-scope1-2-3-boundary"},"next":{"title":"社会尽调/劳工数据聚合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/esg-scope3-sustainability-reporting/scope3-data-aggregation/social-data-supplier-aggregate"}}